+its SN, an LLR for its SR, and a TC for every row it verifies. An approved
+child under a `Drafted` parent claims a chain nobody has blessed.
+
+In a lane, read [references/in-lane.md](references/in-lane.md) before you
+author or judge: how a lane's change set is closed and judged in one sitting,
+and how it splits at a held rung.
 
